{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00158",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 3.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Good morning, how are you doing today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 5.11,
      "end_seconds": 8.18,
      "duration_seconds": 3.07,
      "text": "Hello. Is it okay if I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 9.01,
      "end_seconds": 10.18,
      "duration_seconds": 1.17,
      "text": "Was parking alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.54,
      "end_seconds": 14.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Not great, I ended up a few streets away."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.23,
      "end_seconds": 17.1,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "So, how have things been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.0,
      "end_seconds": 23.83,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Mainly a pounding headache. There's a couple of other things, but that's the main one."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 24.28,
      "end_seconds": 26.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "Alright, and when did that start?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.01,
      "end_seconds": 29.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "For about a week, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.05,
      "end_seconds": 33.16,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "What's the pattern, is it there all day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 34.42,
      "end_seconds": 37.48,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "Honestly, a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.39,
      "end_seconds": 41.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.71,
      "end_seconds": 44.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Pretty severe, if I'm being honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.88,
      "end_seconds": 48.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "Go on. Right, is there anything that triggers it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.96,
      "end_seconds": 52.68,
      "duration_seconds": 3.72,
      "text": "Yeah, it's worse with loud noise and bright lights."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.33,
      "end_seconds": 54.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Any vomiting as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 55.11,
      "end_seconds": 64.89,
      "duration_seconds": 9.78,
      "text": "Mm, yes. With vomiting, it's on and off. Right, and there's flashing lights before it starts as well, three days now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 65.44,
      "end_seconds": 68.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Do you have any questions before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.15,
      "end_seconds": 80.96,
      "duration_seconds": 11.81,
      "text": "Not at the moment, I think you've covered most of what I was wondering. If something comes to mind later, I'll ask you before I leave."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.6,
      "end_seconds": 83.74,
      "duration_seconds": 2.14,
      "text": "Any slurred speech or neck stiffness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 84.91,
      "end_seconds": 87.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "No, no slurred speech or neck stiffness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 88.86,
      "end_seconds": 92.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.1,
      "text": "Any fever or weakness in the arms or legs at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.66,
      "end_seconds": 99.22,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I haven't had fever or weakness in the arms or legs, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.76,
      "end_seconds": 103.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "And your skin, any changes there?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.59,
      "end_seconds": 106.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "No, skin's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.17,
      "end_seconds": 110.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.82,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.4,
      "end_seconds": 113.55,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "No problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.78,
      "end_seconds": 118.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "What about your general health, any conditions you're being treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 119.35,
      "end_seconds": 127.77,
      "duration_seconds": 8.42,
      "text": "I've had high blood pressure, yes. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.18,
      "end_seconds": 137.08,
      "duration_seconds": 7.9,
      "text": "Go on. Yes, I can see the high blood pressure in your file as well. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 137.72,
      "end_seconds": 153.81,
      "duration_seconds": 16.09,
      "text": "Um, not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 155.27,
      "end_seconds": 158.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "So, are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 159.06,
      "end_seconds": 162.28,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "It's ramipril, 5 milligrams, maybe, every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.1,
      "end_seconds": 166.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "Did you happen to bring the box or the paperwork?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 167.51,
      "end_seconds": 169.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "No, it's at home."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 173.29,
      "end_seconds": 177.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Alright, is it all right if a trainee sits in later? No? Fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 177.83,
      "end_seconds": 181.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I'd rather not, if you don't mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.28,
      "end_seconds": 183.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.49,
      "text": "And alcohol, how much?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.13,
      "end_seconds": 188.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.65,
      "end_seconds": 190.79,
      "duration_seconds": 1.14,
      "text": "Do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.28,
      "end_seconds": 195.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "I smoke about ten cigarettes a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.67,
      "end_seconds": 209.06,
      "duration_seconds": 13.39,
      "text": "I'll be straight with you about how this works. Most of what we see in clinic turns out to be manageable, and the history you give me is often more useful than any single test, so thank you for being so detailed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.86,
      "end_seconds": 211.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Thank you, that really helps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.04,
      "end_seconds": 215.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.25,
      "text": "Any allergies I should know about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 217.98,
      "end_seconds": 219.21,
      "duration_seconds": 1.23,
      "text": "Shellfish, I'd say."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.11,
      "end_seconds": 224.11,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "Right, have you been able to keep up with your usual activities?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 225.28,
      "end_seconds": 238.22,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "For the most part, yes. I just carry on and try not to dwell on things too much, though I won't pretend it hasn't crossed my mind a few times."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.09,
      "end_seconds": 242.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Give me a second, I'm just scrolling back through your chart."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 243.29,
      "end_seconds": 244.13,
      "duration_seconds": 0.84,
      "text": "Of course."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.66,
      "end_seconds": 274.76,
      "duration_seconds": 16.1,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 275.1,
      "end_seconds": 277.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.82,
      "text": "I, I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 279.0,
      "end_seconds": 301.33,
      "duration_seconds": 22.33,
      "text": "Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is a migraine pattern. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out cluster headache yet. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a pounding headache for about a week, severe, and no neck stiffness or weakness in the arms or legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.71,
      "end_seconds": 305.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "Exactly, you know, that's what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 306.61,
      "end_seconds": 310.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Is there anything you were hoping to get out of today's visit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 313.19,
      "end_seconds": 316.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Mostly I just want to understand what's going on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 316.98,
      "end_seconds": 325.31,
      "duration_seconds": 8.33,
      "text": "I'm going to order an MRI of the brain, for recurrent headaches. The result will help us decide whether anything more is needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 326.5,
      "end_seconds": 328.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "Alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.17,
      "end_seconds": 334.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.47,
      "text": "Let's use domperidone, 10 milligrams, when nauseous, as needed. It's for migraine nausea."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 335.59,
      "end_seconds": 337.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.66,
      "text": "Right, I'll remember that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 338.48,
      "end_seconds": 350.33,
      "duration_seconds": 11.85,
      "text": "I'd like you to take sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, at the start of an attack, as needed. That should help with migraine. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 350.64,
      "end_seconds": 353.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Okay, and I take that after food?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0061",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 354.27,
      "end_seconds": 374.88,
      "duration_seconds": 20.61,
      "text": "Keep a headache diary, things like skipped meals, poor sleep, certain foods and the weather. Try not to skip meals and keep your sleep regular. If you smoke, this is a good moment to think about stopping, and we can help you with that. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to the next visit, so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0062",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 375.53,
      "end_seconds": 376.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "Okay, I will."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0063",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 378.4,
      "end_seconds": 388.64,
      "duration_seconds": 10.24,
      "text": "I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you have the worst headache of your life or any weakness. Please come and see me in six weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0064",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.97,
      "end_seconds": 389.67,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0065",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 390.18,
      "end_seconds": 394.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.68,
      "text": "Let me check that I've been clear. What will you do once you get home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0066",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 396.43,
      "end_seconds": 405.88,
      "duration_seconds": 9.45,
      "text": "So, I take the domperidone, 10 milligrams, when nauseous and take the sumatriptan, 50 milligrams, at the start of an attack. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0067",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 406.4,
      "end_seconds": 410.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Okay, yes, exactly right. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0068",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 412.05,
      "end_seconds": 415.3,
      "duration_seconds": 3.25,
      "text": "Uh, I appreciate your time, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0069",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 416.77,
      "end_seconds": 417.47,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}